# Root Environment Configuration

# MaxMind GeoLite2 License Key
# Optional: Enables automated download of the GeoLite2-City.mmdb database
# Used by scripts/update-geolite2.js
# Get a license key from MaxMind (https://www.maxmind.com/en/accounts/current/license-key)
MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY=

# Instructions:
# 1. Rename this file to .env (or set the variable in your shell environment).
# 2. The GeoIP database download is optional but recommended for production.
# 3. Without it, the application falls back to an API-based geolocation service with reduced throughput.